--No index used a Seq Scan which took 49.457 ms to execute. With index, it switch to a Bitmap Index Scan, which reduced the 
-- execution time to 11.879 ms. When I created the compound index, is was also a Bitmap Index Scan. Using the compund index with
--a more selective query, the executed time was 4.945 ms. Because this table was a large table of 100000 records, we benefitted from 
--using indexes because it was able to narrow down the results. 

